OL,3,GNEWSAWoman asked for medical help      
OL,4,Abefore custody death                   
OL,6,FA woman asked to see a healthcare      
OL,7,Fprofessional twice before she died in  
OL,8,Fpolice custody in Nottingham, an       
OL,9,Finquest has heard.                     
OL,11,FAbigail Steele, 34, was found          
OL,12,Funresponsive in a cell at custody      
OL,13,Fsuites in Radford Road on 31 October   
OL,14,F2024.                                  
OL,16,FShe had been arrested the previous day 
OL,17,Fand was remanded in custody, where she 
OL,18,Fsaid she was suffering from alcohol and
OL,19,Fdrug withdrawal after being charged    
OL,20,Fwith an offence.                       
