OL,3,GNEWSAWoman asked for medical help      
OL,4,Abefore custody death                   
OL,6,FDuring the first day of evidence at an 
OL,7,Finquest at Nottingham Coroner's Court  
OL,8,Fon Monday, a jury was told Steele's    
OL,9,Fmedical cause of death remained        
OL,10,F"unascertained".                       
